n the imperfect with ua-; one uses the jussive with verbs that have preserved a distinct form for it (v. ci-dessous § 200)."},{"word":"jussion","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒy.sjɔ̃/","gender":"f","en":["an order issued by a superior authority"],"example":"Des lettres de jussion contraignirent le Parlement d’obéir.\tLetters of command constrained Parilament to obey."},{"word":"jussiée","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"gender":"f","en":["primrose"]},{"word":"justau","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.to/","gender":"m","en":["leotard; leo"],"example":"Un soir, j'ai rempli un sac poubelle avec toutes mes affaires de gym: justaus, survêts, chaussons, maniques et tout.\tOne evening, I filled a trash bag with all of my belongings from the gym: leotards, tracksuits, slippers, tiger paws, and all."},{"word":"juste ciel","pos":"interjection","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.tə sjɛl/","en":["good heavens!"]},{"word":"juste milieu","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.t(ə) mi.ljø/","gender":"m","en":["balance, golden mean, happy medium, middle ground"],"example":"trouver un juste milieu\tto find a middle ground"},{"word":"juste prix","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.t(ə) pʁi/","gender":"m","en":["fair value"]},{"word":"justice immanente","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.ti.s‿i.ma.nɑ̃t/","gender":"f","en":["poetic justice"]},{"word":"justice originelle","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"gender":"f","en":["original justice"]},{"word":"justice sociale","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.tis sɔ.sjal/","gender":"f","en":["social justice"]},{"word":"justifiablement","pos":"adverb","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.ti.fja.blə.mɑ̃/","en":["justifiably"]},{"word":"justificateur","pos":"adjective","rank":1000000,"en":["justificatory"]},{"word":"justifié","pos":"adjective","rank":1000000,"en":["justified"]},{"word":"justinianéen","pos":"adjective","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒys.ti.nja.ne.ɛ̃/","en":["Justinianian"]},{"word":"juveigneur","pos":"noun","rank":1000000,"ipa":"/ʒy.vɛ.ɲœʁ